From: dun4d <mail@dun4d.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 22:35:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libavcodec/ajpgdec: AJPG decoder

AJPG is a format supported by some early webcams. Bayer sensor data stored in JPEG.

Signed-off-by: Jack Dunford <jackdunford@gmail.com>
---
 libavcodec/ajpgdec.c | 512 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 512 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ajpgdec.c
